'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[heavy armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Both the body armor and [[helmet]] can be bought from the [[Steeled Veterans Premium Warbond|Steeled Veterans]] page of the [[Superstore#Permanent_Catalog|Permanent Catalog]] on the [[Superstore]] for {{Currency|SC|400|notext}} and 200 [[Super Credits]], respectively.

==Passive Ability==
{{Armor Passive Info Panel|Extra Padding}}

== Trivia ==

* This armor set is the only Heavy Armor with the Extra Padding passive, boasting the highest available armor rating of 200.
* Visually, the B-27 Fortified Commando resembles an EOD suit but lacks a  heightened collar most EOD suits have.

